{"seq":4,"slug":"set-operations","title":"集合操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/advanced-queries/set-operations","wordCount":698,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"集合操作\">集合操作</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>集合操作将两个或多个查询的结果集按集合论规则合并。SQL 提供四种集合操作：UNION（并集）、INTERSECT（交集）、EXCEPT（差集），以及对应的 ALL 变体。集合操作要求参与的查询具有相同的列数和兼容的数据类型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;UNION (A ∪ B)&quot;&#10;        A1[集合 A] --&gt; R1[合并去重]&#10;        B1[集合 B] --&gt; R1&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;INTERSECT (A ∩ B)&quot;&#10;        A2[集合 A] --&gt; R2[取交集]&#10;        B2[集合 B] --&gt; R2&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;EXCEPT (A - B)&quot;&#10;        A3[集合 A] --&gt; R3[从 A 中移除 B]&#10;        B3[集合 B] --&gt; R3&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"UNION (A ∪ B)\"\n        A1[集合 A] --&gt; R1[合并去重]\n        B1[集合 B] --&gt; R1\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"INTERSECT (A ∩ B)\"\n        A2[集合 A] --&gt; R2[取交集]\n        B2[集合 B] --&gt; R2\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"EXCEPT (A - B)\"\n        A3[集合 A] --&gt; R3[从 A 中移除 B]\n        B3[集合 B] --&gt; R3\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>去重</th>\n<th>性能开销</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>UNION</td>\n<td>合并两个结果集</td>\n<td>是（排序/哈希去重）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>合并不同来源的数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UNION ALL</td>\n<td>合并两个结果集</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>已知无重复或允许重复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INTERSECT</td>\n<td>两个结果集的交集</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>查找共同元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INTERSECT ALL</td>\n<td>交集保留重复</td>\n<td>保留最小重复次数</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>带重复计数的交集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXCEPT</td>\n<td>从第一个集合中移除第二个集合</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>差异查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXCEPT ALL</td>\n<td>差集保留重复</td>\n<td>逐一移除匹配</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>带重复计数的差集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"union-与-union-all\">UNION 与 UNION ALL</h2><p>UNION 合并两个查询的结果并去除重复行，UNION ALL 保留所有行（包括重复）。由于去重需要排序或哈希，UNION ALL 的性能显著优于 UNION。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const unionExamples = `&#10;-- UNION ALL：合并多个事件来源（已知不重复）&#10;SELECT user_id, &#39;login&#39; AS event_type, login_time AS event_time&#10;FROM login_events&#10;UNION ALL&#10;SELECT user_id, &#39;purchase&#39;, purchase_time&#10;FROM purchase_events&#10;UNION ALL&#10;SELECT user_id, &#39;pageview&#39;, view_time&#10;FROM pageview_events&#10;ORDER BY event_time DESC;&#10;&#10;-- UNION：合并并去重&#10;SELECT email FROM customers&#10;UNION&#10;SELECT email FROM newsletter_subscribers;&#10;&#10;-- UNION ALL + GROUP BY 替代 UNION（更灵活）&#10;SELECT email, COUNT(*) AS source_count&#10;FROM (&#10;    SELECT email FROM customers&#10;    UNION ALL&#10;    SELECT email FROM newsletter_subscribers&#10;) combined&#10;GROUP BY email;&#10;&#10;-- 多表分区查询（历史表 + 当前表）&#10;SELECT order_id, amount, created_at FROM orders_2024&#10;WHERE created_at &gt;= &#39;2024-06-01&#39;&#10;UNION ALL&#10;SELECT order_id, amount, created_at FROM orders_archive&#10;WHERE created_at &gt;= &#39;2023-06-01&#39; AND created_at &lt; &#39;2024-01-01&#39;;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unionExamples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- UNION ALL：合并多个事件来源（已知不重复）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT user_id, 'login' AS event_type, login_time AS event_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM login_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT user_id, 'purchase', purchase_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM purchase_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT user_id, 'pageview', view_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM pageview_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ORDER BY event_time DESC;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- UNION：合并并去重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT email FROM customers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UNION</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT email FROM newsletter_subscribers;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- UNION ALL + GROUP BY 替代 UNION（更灵活）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT email, COUNT(*) AS source_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT email FROM customers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT email FROM newsletter_subscribers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) combined</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY email;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 多表分区查询（历史表 + 当前表）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT order_id, amount, created_at FROM orders_2024</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE created_at >= '2024-06-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT order_id, amount, created_at FROM orders_archive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE created_at >= '2023-06-01' AND created_at &#x3C; '2024-01-01';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>选择</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>已知两个查询无重复</td>\n<td>UNION ALL</td>\n<td>避免去重开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要去重</td>\n<td>UNION</td>\n<td>自动去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要统计来源数量</td>\n<td>UNION ALL + GROUP BY</td>\n<td>比 UNION 更灵活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并分区表</td>\n<td>UNION ALL</td>\n<td>分区间无重叠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"intersect-交集\">INTERSECT 交集</h2><p>INTERSECT 返回同时存在于两个结果集中的行。它比使用 INNER JOIN 或 EXISTS 更简洁，尤其在比较整行数据时。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const intersectExamples = `&#10;-- 查找既是客户又订阅了新闻的用户&#10;SELECT user_id FROM customers&#10;INTERSECT&#10;SELECT user_id FROM newsletter_subscribers;&#10;&#10;-- 等价的 EXISTS 写法&#10;SELECT DISTINCT c.user_id &#10;FROM customers c&#10;WHERE EXISTS (&#10;    SELECT 1 FROM newsletter_subscribers n WHERE n.user_id = c.user_id&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- INTERSECT ALL 保留重复次数&#10;-- 集合 A: {1, 1, 2, 3}&#10;-- 集合 B: {1, 1, 1, 3}&#10;-- INTERSECT ALL 结果: {1, 1, 3}（取每个值的最小出现次数）&#10;&#10;-- 多条件交集：同时满足多个标签&#10;SELECT product_id FROM product_tags WHERE tag = &#39;热销&#39;&#10;INTERSECT&#10;SELECT product_id FROM product_tags WHERE tag = &#39;新品&#39;&#10;INTERSECT&#10;SELECT product_id FROM product_tags WHERE tag = &#39;包邮&#39;;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> intersectExamples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 查找既是客户又订阅了新闻的用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT user_id FROM customers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INTERSECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT user_id FROM newsletter_subscribers;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 等价的 EXISTS 写法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT DISTINCT c.user_id </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM customers c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE EXISTS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT 1 FROM newsletter_subscribers n WHERE n.user_id = c.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- INTERSECT ALL 保留重复次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 集合 A: {1, 1, 2, 3}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 集合 B: {1, 1, 1, 3}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- INTERSECT ALL 结果: {1, 1, 3}（取每个值的最小出现次数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 多条件交集：同时满足多个标签</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT product_id FROM product_tags WHERE tag = '热销'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INTERSECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT product_id FROM product_tags WHERE tag = '新品'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INTERSECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT product_id FROM product_tags WHERE tag = '包邮';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>INTERSECT 对 NULL 的处理与等值比较不同——两个 NULL 值在 INTERSECT 中被视为相等（而 <code>NULL = NULL</code> 返回 UNKNOWN）。这是集合操作的特殊语义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"except-差集\">EXCEPT 差集</h2><p>EXCEPT 返回在第一个结果集中存在但不在第二个结果集中的行。它是查找差异和排除数据的简洁方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const exceptExamples = `&#10;-- 查找未下过订单的用户&#10;SELECT user_id FROM users&#10;EXCEPT&#10;SELECT DISTINCT user_id FROM orders;&#10;&#10;-- 等价的 NOT EXISTS 写法&#10;SELECT u.user_id FROM users u&#10;WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id);&#10;&#10;-- 数据对比：找出两个环境的差异&#10;SELECT table_name, column_name, data_type&#10;FROM production_schema.columns&#10;EXCEPT&#10;SELECT table_name, column_name, data_type&#10;FROM staging_schema.columns;&#10;&#10;-- 双向差异（完整对比）&#10;-- A 有但 B 没有&#10;(SELECT * FROM table_a EXCEPT SELECT * FROM table_b)&#10;UNION ALL&#10;-- B 有但 A 没有&#10;(SELECT * FROM table_b EXCEPT SELECT * FROM table_a);&#10;&#10;-- EXCEPT ALL：逐一移除匹配&#10;-- 集合 A: {1, 1, 2, 3, 3}&#10;-- 集合 B: {1, 3}&#10;-- EXCEPT ALL 结果: {1, 2, 3}（从 A 中各移除一个匹配）&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> exceptExamples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 查找未下过订单的用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT user_id FROM users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXCEPT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT DISTINCT user_id FROM orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 等价的 NOT EXISTS 写法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT u.user_id FROM users u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM orders o WHERE o.user_id = u.user_id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 数据对比：找出两个环境的差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT table_name, column_name, data_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM production_schema.columns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXCEPT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT table_name, column_name, data_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM staging_schema.columns;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 双向差异（完整对比）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- A 有但 B 没有</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(SELECT * FROM table_a EXCEPT SELECT * FROM table_b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- B 有但 A 没有</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(SELECT * FROM table_b EXCEPT SELECT * FROM table_a);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- EXCEPT ALL：逐一移除匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 集合 A: {1, 1, 2, 3, 3}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 集合 B: {1, 3}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- EXCEPT ALL 结果: {1, 2, 3}（从 A 中各移除一个匹配）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"集合操作的组合与优化\">集合操作的组合与优化</h2><p>多个集合操作可以组合使用，但需要注意执行优先级和括号的使用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const combinedOperations = `&#10;-- INTERSECT 优先级高于 UNION（SQL 标准）&#10;-- A UNION B INTERSECT C 等价于 A UNION (B INTERSECT C)&#10;-- 建议始终使用括号明确优先级&#10;&#10;-- 复杂组合：核心用户 = (活跃用户 ∩ 付费用户) - 黑名单&#10;(&#10;    SELECT user_id FROM active_users&#10;    INTERSECT&#10;    SELECT user_id FROM paid_users&#10;)&#10;EXCEPT&#10;SELECT user_id FROM blacklist;&#10;&#10;-- 性能优化：用 JOIN 替代集合操作&#10;-- 当两个集合都很大时，INTERSECT 可能不如 JOIN 高效&#10;-- INTERSECT 替代：&#10;SELECT a.user_id&#10;FROM active_users a&#10;INNER JOIN paid_users p ON a.user_id = p.user_id&#10;WHERE a.user_id NOT IN (SELECT user_id FROM blacklist);&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> combinedOperations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- INTERSECT 优先级高于 UNION（SQL 标准）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- A UNION B INTERSECT C 等价于 A UNION (B INTERSECT C)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 建议始终使用括号明确优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 复杂组合：核心用户 = (活跃用户 ∩ 付费用户) - 黑名单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT user_id FROM active_users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    INTERSECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT user_id FROM paid_users</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXCEPT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT user_id FROM blacklist;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 性能优化：用 JOIN 替代集合操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 当两个集合都很大时，INTERSECT 可能不如 JOIN 高效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- INTERSECT 替代：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT a.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM active_users a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INNER JOIN paid_users p ON a.user_id = p.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE a.user_id NOT IN (SELECT user_id FROM blacklist);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[选择集合操作策略] --&gt; B{数据量大小}&#10;    B --&gt;|小数据集| C[直接使用 UNION/INTERSECT/EXCEPT]&#10;    B --&gt;|大数据集| D{操作类型}&#10;    D --&gt;|合并| E[UNION ALL 优先]&#10;    D --&gt;|交集| F[考虑 JOIN 替代]&#10;    D --&gt;|差集| G[考虑 NOT EXISTS 替代]&#10;&#10;    E --&gt; H[是否需要去重?]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| I[UNION ALL]&#10;    H --&gt;|是| J[UNION ALL + GROUP BY]\">graph TD\n    A[选择集合操作策略] --&gt; B{数据量大小}\n    B --&gt;|小数据集| C[直接使用 UNION/INTERSECT/EXCEPT]\n    B --&gt;|大数据集| D{操作类型}\n    D --&gt;|合并| E[UNION ALL 优先]\n    D --&gt;|交集| F[考虑 JOIN 替代]\n    D --&gt;|差集| G[考虑 NOT EXISTS 替代]\n\n    E --&gt; H[是否需要去重?]\n    H --&gt;|否| I[UNION ALL]\n    H --&gt;|是| J[UNION ALL + GROUP BY]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>集合操作</th>\n<th>JOIN 等价写法</th>\n<th>何时用集合操作</th>\n<th>何时用 JOIN</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>UNION</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>不同结构来源</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INTERSECT</td>\n<td>INNER JOIN</td>\n<td>简洁表达</td>\n<td>需要额外列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXCEPT</td>\n<td>LEFT JOIN + IS NULL</td>\n<td>简洁表达</td>\n<td>需要关联信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>UNION ALL 无去重开销，优先于 UNION 使用；只在确实需要去重时才用 UNION</li>\n<li>INTERSECT 查找交集，在集合操作中 NULL 值被视为相等，这与等值比较不同</li>\n<li>EXCEPT 查找差集，是 NOT EXISTS 的简洁替代</li>\n<li>集合操作要求列数和类型兼容，ORDER BY 只能出现在最终结果上</li>\n<li>INTERSECT 优先级高于 UNION，建议使用括号明确组合顺序</li>\n<li>大数据集上考虑用 JOIN / EXISTS 替代 INTERSECT / EXCEPT，优化器可能生成更好的执行计划</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"集合操作","id":"集合操作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"UNION 与 UNION ALL","id":"union-与-union-all"},{"level":2,"text":"INTERSECT 交集","id":"intersect-交集"},{"level":2,"text":"EXCEPT 差集","id":"except-差集"},{"level":2,"text":"集合操作的组合与优化","id":"集合操作的组合与优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CTE 与递归查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/advanced-queries/cte-and-recursive"},"next":{"title":"索引策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/performance-tuning/index-strategy"}}